#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:4
msgid "Migrating from Elasticsearch to OpenSearch"
msgstr "Migration d'Elasticsearch vers OpenSearch"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:6
msgid ""
"Starting with |morpheus| 8.1.0, the embedded search service changed from "
"Elasticsearch to OpenSearch. This migration only affects appliances "
"upgrading from earlier versions — fresh installations and HVM deployments"
" already use OpenSearch."
msgstr "À partir de |morpheus| 8.1.0, le service de recherche intégré est passé d'Elasticsearch à OpenSearch. Cette migration concerne uniquement les appliances passant de versions antérieures — les nouvelles installations et les déploiements HVM utilisent déjà OpenSearch."

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:8
msgid "During upgrade, the reconfigure process will:"
msgstr "Lors de la mise à niveau, le processus de reconfigure :"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:10
msgid "Automatically disable the old Elasticsearch service"
msgstr "Désactive automatiquement l'ancien service Elasticsearch"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:11
msgid "Start OpenSearch in its place"
msgstr "Démarre OpenSearch à sa place"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:12
msgid ""
"Migrate the Elasticsearch PKCS12 CA to PEM format if ``secure_mode`` is "
"enabled"
msgstr "Migre l'ACI PKCS12 Elasticsearch au format PEM si ``secure_mode`` est activé"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:14
msgid ""
"No changes to ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb`` are required. Existing "
"``elasticsearch[...]`` settings are bridged to the ``opensearch`` "
"namespace automatically."
msgstr "Aucune modification de ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb`` n'est requise. Les paramètres ``elasticsearch[...]`` existants sont automatiquement transférés vers l'espace de noms ``opensearch``."

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:16
msgid "Important"
msgstr "Important"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:18
msgid ""
"Data (indices) must be migrated separately using ``morpheus-ctl migrate-"
"elasticsearch``. Run ``morpheus-ctl migrate-elasticsearch help`` on an "
"appliance after upgrade for full usage information."
msgstr "Les données (index) doivent être migrées séparément à l'aide de ``morpheus-ctl migrate-elasticsearch``. Exécutez ``morpheus-ctl migrate-elasticsearch help`` sur une appliance après la mise à niveau pour obtenir les informations d'utilisation complètes."

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:21
msgid "Single Node — Upgrading from Elasticsearch"
msgstr "Nœud unique — Mise à niveau depuis Elasticsearch"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:23
#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:55
#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:114
msgid "**Step 1 — Upgrade the Morpheus package**"
msgstr "**Étape 1 — Mettre à niveau le package Morpheus**"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:25
msgid "Install the new |morpheus| package. Do **NOT** run reconfigure yet."
msgstr "Installez le nouveau package |morpheus|. N'exécutez **PAS** encore reconfigure."

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:27
msgid "**Step 2 — Run the migration script**"
msgstr "**Étape 2 — Exécuter le script de migration**"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:29
msgid ""
"For single-node appliances, the migration script handles everything "
"automatically:"
msgstr "Pour les appliances mononœud, le script de migration gère tout automatiquement :"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:31
#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:89
msgid "sudo morpheus-ctl migrate-elasticsearch"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:35
msgid "This script does the following:"
msgstr "Ce script effectue les opérations suivantes :"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:37
msgid ""
"Starts a temporary Elasticsearch instance using the preserved ES "
"installation"
msgstr "Démarre une instance Elasticsearch temporaire utilisant l'installation ES conservée"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:38
msgid ""
"Resets voting configuration if needed (for nodes which were previously "
"part of a cluster)"
msgstr "Réinitialise la configuration de vote si nécessaire (pour les nœuds qui faisaient précédemment partie d'un cluster)"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:39
msgid "Sets replicas to 0 for single-node operation"
msgstr "Définit les réplicas à 0 pour le fonctionnement mononœud"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:40
msgid "Exports all indices to JSON files"
msgstr "Exporte tous les index vers des fichiers JSON"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:41
msgid "Imports into OpenSearch"
msgstr "Importe dans OpenSearch"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:42
msgid "Stops the temporary ES cluster"
msgstr "Arrête le cluster ES temporaire"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:44
msgid "**Step 3 — Reconfigure**"
msgstr "**Étape 3 — Reconfigure**"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:46
#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:105
#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:122
msgid "morpheus-ctl reconfigure"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:50
msgid ""
"The old Elasticsearch service is disabled automatically and OpenSearch "
"starts in its place. If ``secure_mode`` was enabled, the Elasticsearch "
"PKCS12 CA is automatically migrated to PEM format."
msgstr "L'ancien service Elasticsearch est désactivé automatiquement et OpenSearch démarre à sa place. Si ``secure_mode`` était activé, l'ACI PKCS12 Elasticsearch est automatiquement migrée au format PEM."

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:53
msgid "3-Node Cluster — Upgrading from Elasticsearch"
msgstr "Cluster 3 nœuds — Mise à niveau depuis Elasticsearch"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:57
msgid ""
"Install the new |morpheus| package on all 3 nodes. Do **not** run "
"reconfigure yet. The preinstall script preserves the Elasticsearch "
"installation at ``/var/opt/morpheus/elasticsearch-8.15.5/home/``. The ES "
"data and binaries are preserved across package install, reconfigure, and "
"normal operation — the migration export can be run at any time until the "
"ES data is removed."
msgstr "Installez le nouveau package |morpheus| sur les 3 nœuds. N'exécutez **pas** encore reconfigure. Le script preinstall conserve l'installation Elasticsearch à ``/var/opt/morpheus/elasticsearch-8.15.5/home/``. Les données et binaires ES sont conservés lors de l'installation du package, de reconfigure et du fonctionnement normal — l'export de migration peut être exécuté à tout moment jusqu'à la suppression des données ES."

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:59
msgid "**Step 2 — Check the ES cluster configuration**"
msgstr "**Étape 2 — Vérifier la configuration du cluster ES**"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:61
msgid ""
"Run the following and note the ``discovery.seed_hosts`` and "
"``cluster.initial_master_nodes``:"
msgstr "Exécutez ce qui suit et notez ``discovery.seed_hosts`` et ``cluster.initial_master_nodes`` :"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:63
msgid "cat /var/opt/morpheus/elasticsearch-8.15.5/home/config/elasticsearch.yml"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:67
msgid "**Step 3 — Start Elasticsearch on all nodes**"
msgstr "**Étape 3 — Démarrer Elasticsearch sur tous les nœuds**"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:69
msgid ""
"Start ES on each node within 30 seconds of each other (order does not "
"matter):"
msgstr "Démarrez ES sur chaque nœud dans un intervalle de 30 secondes (l'ordre n'a pas d'importance) :"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:71
msgid ""
"su -s /bin/bash es-morpheus -c "
"'ES_JAVA_HOME=/var/opt/morpheus/elasticsearch-8.15.5/home/jdk "
"/var/opt/morpheus/elasticsearch-8.15.5/home/bin/elasticsearch -d'"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:75
msgid "**Step 4 — Verify cluster health**"
msgstr "**Étape 4 — Vérifier l'état du cluster**"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:77
#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:87
msgid "From any node:"
msgstr "Depuis n'importe quel nœud :"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:79
msgid "curl http://127.0.0.1:9200/_cluster/health?pretty"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:83
msgid ""
"You should see: ``\"status\": \"green\"``, ``\"number_of_nodes\": 3``, "
"``\"unassigned_shards\": 0``"
msgstr "Vous devriez voir : ``\"status\": \"green\"``, ``\"number_of_nodes\": 3``, ``\"unassigned_shards\": 0``"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:85
msgid "**Step 5 — Run the migration export**"
msgstr "**Étape 5 — Exécuter l'export de migration**"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:93
msgid "The script will detect the running ES cluster and export from it."
msgstr "Le script détectera le cluster ES en cours d'exécution et exportera depuis celui-ci."

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:95
msgid "**Step 6 — Stop Elasticsearch on all nodes**"
msgstr "**Étape 6 — Arrêter Elasticsearch sur tous les nœuds**"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:97
msgid "After the migration completes, on each node:"
msgstr "Une fois la migration terminée, sur chaque nœud :"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:99
msgid "pkill -f 'elasticsearch-8.15.5'"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:103
msgid "**Step 7 — Reconfigure all nodes**"
msgstr "**Étape 7 — Reconfigure sur tous les nœuds**"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:110
msgid "External Cluster — Upgrading"
msgstr "Cluster externe — Mise à niveau"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:112
msgid ""
"If the existing |morpheus| installation was already configured to use an "
"external Elasticsearch or OpenSearch cluster, the upgrade is "
"straightforward — no data migration is needed on the appliance side since"
" the data lives on the external cluster. The external cluster does not "
"need to be migrated to OpenSearch; |morpheus| supports both."
msgstr "Si l'installation |morpheus| existante était déjà configurée pour utiliser un cluster Elasticsearch ou OpenSearch externe, la mise à niveau est simple — aucune migration de données n'est nécessaire côté appliance car les données se trouvent sur le cluster externe. Le cluster externe n'a pas besoin d'être migré vers OpenSearch ; |morpheus| prend en charge les deux."

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:116
msgid "Install the new |morpheus| package on each appliance node."
msgstr "Installez le nouveau package |morpheus| sur chaque nœud d'appliance."

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:118
msgid "**Step 2 — Reconfigure**"
msgstr "**Étape 2 — Reconfigure**"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/opensearch_migration.rst:120
msgid ""
"No ``morpheus.rb`` changes are needed. The existing "
"``elasticsearch[...]`` settings are bridged automatically."
msgstr "Aucune modification de ``morpheus.rb`` n'est nécessaire. Les paramètres ``elasticsearch[...]`` existants sont transférés automatiquement."

